테크 (7)","items":["테크 (7)"]},{"k":"사이트 크기","v":"5 X 5 : 7개"},{"k":"글램핑 내부시설","v":"침대 · 냉장고 · 난방기구","items":["침대","냉장고","난방기구"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"텐트 · 릴선 · 화로대 · 난방기구 · 식기 · 침낭","items":["텐트","릴선","화로대","난방기구","식기","침낭"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (14) · 화재감지기 (7)","items":["소화기 (14)","화재감지기 (7)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/3414KmIt1sniW4r12Hn1UDVW.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/9361QerE3FFgDfdHNwGhQiWb.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/6126pGK4XBsdSb33wEPR3XrB.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/6602x2zSZ69C7Kq7b69VOfmM.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/7638vRU8Nm3KDDqZn571EVLt.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/7410EQsL8w92EpuL7F0HZ12N.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/6096UnsdPS9BxOmgK3Omcra9.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/7854Axz4yzVVWzjRiIMeYd2q.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/4535Tgt47uGZgBYCCCBWSjpW.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/8458Rjn3cWm3SeQyESXXpXBZ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/6684U0GJmc5tFrPmE0iulxN2.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/1035FA9HWLRMnP74RTnNpctZ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/3512EFve6qlzQyIlUl5I60lC.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/4005hj4WtDoxbloJs7dzDkVB.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/67414eMUFNI2VsGjkiREFa0k.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/94152ubyBDdAQ7JMgyb3Qi6o.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/8804dEV7L645Zu30tAKVlzmw.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/5601Gdk154NeL2G9VnGZ1iHB.jpg"],"layout":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3354/0446sBQZZlsVtZ7MA1MqGzOU.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"일반캠핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"일반","values":["20,000","30,000","40,000","40,000"]}]}},{"title":"글램핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 